{"id":"n71128-1-2","stage":0,"title":"이거 · 这个","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71128-1-2-1","ko":"이리 와서 이거 좀 같이 들어 줄래?","zh":"过来，能帮我一起拿一下这个吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이리","meaning":"往这边，朝这里","explanation":"이리：往这边，朝这里","readings":[{"term":"이리","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91328","senseId":"1","lemma":"이리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어","meaning":"带，提，拎","explanation":"들다：带，提，拎；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄래?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"062801c7a30dc6ce","term":"이리","zh":"往这边，朝这里","audio":"/audio/062801c7a30dc6cea780.mp3","entryId":"91328","definition":"向着这个地方；或向着这个方向。","pronunciation":["이리"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"带，提，拎","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"57293","definition":"手里拿着。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/18be1cc79bd433dd26fe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71128-1-2-2","ko":"알았어요, 엄마.","zh":"好的，妈妈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알았어요,","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄마.","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指